<title>NEW ZEALAND: Gandava bid for Transmark unconditional.</title>
<headline>Gandava bid for Transmark unconditional.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gandava Investments Ltd said on Wednesday it had 92.3 percent of Transmark Corp Ltd and its bid was now unconditional.</p>
<p>The date for acceptance of the offer had been extended until February 3, 1997.</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom 64 4 473-4746</p>
</text>
